* /**
*  * @file CMD.INIT
*  * @version 1.0
*  */
* CMD.INIT(name, description) — begin defining a command.
* Platform compile-time defines (MV / UDT / UV / D3): the mvpkg-shared header,
* provisioned per account by MVPKG init.  Included unconditionally — MVX is a
* builtin compiler define, but the vendor symbols only exist via this header.
SUBROUTINE CMD.INIT(NAME, DESC)
$INCLUDE MVPKG.INC PLATFORM.H
COMMON /CMDPKG/ CNAME, CDESC, CSUBS, CDESCS, CHANDLERS, CFLAGS
CNAME = NAME
CDESC = DESC
CSUBS = ""
CDESCS = ""
CHANDLERS = ""
CFLAGS = ""
RETURN